sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Driver as Driver Browser
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/PostGIS
    participant OTP as OTP Delivery Provider
    participant Worker as MQTT Worker

    Driver->>API: POST /api/v1/collections/{job_id}/depart
    API->>DB: Verify assignment; status ASSIGNED → EN_ROUTE
    Driver->>API: POST /api/v1/collections/{job_id}/arrive {lat, lon, captured_at}
    API->>DB: Validate geofence; status EN_ROUTE → ARRIVED
    Driver->>API: POST /api/v1/collections/{job_id}/otp/issue
    API->>OTP: Deliver OTP to configured facility contact
    Driver->>API: POST /api/v1/collections/{job_id}/start {otp}
    API->>DB: Validate OTP, expiry, attempts; capture fresh before reading
    API-->>Driver: Status COLLECTING + before evidence status
    Driver->>API: POST /api/v1/collections/{job_id}/finish {lat, lon, captured_at}
    API->>DB: Record pickup_finished_at; status remains COLLECTING
    Worker->>DB: Insert new telemetry readings after pickup_finished_at
    Driver->>API: POST /api/v1/collections/{job_id}/verify {lat, lon, captured_at}
    API->>DB: Select fresh after reading server-side; compare evidence
    alt all rules pass
        API->>DB: COLLECTING → VERIFIED; audit evidence
        API-->>Driver: VERIFIED
    else evidence missing or threshold failed
        API->>DB: COLLECTING → ANOMALY; open COLLECTION_ANOMALY alert
        API-->>Driver: ANOMALY + reason codes
    end
    Note over API,DB: Operator may override ANOMALY → VERIFIED only with reason and audit
